WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.268 --> 00:00:03.536
-The Republican Party
and conservative movement

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.071
are now so committed
to an alternate reality

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.972
where Donald Trump
won the 2020 election

00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:10.109
that if you're a Republican
and you depart even slightly

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:12.212
from that deranged lie,
you'll be punished.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.314
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:18.351
♪♪

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.553
Republicans as a party
are just fully out of ideas.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.354
They have nothing constructive
to add

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.623
to the national discourse.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.491
They spend their time
whining hysterically

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:27.927
about hamburgers and Dr. Seuss

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.396
and are still trying to get
the last election overturned.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.933
They're so desperate to be
outraged about utter nonsense,

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.503
they spent an entire day
getting mad

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:38.871
about the Snow White ride
at Disneyland.

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:41.440
-Cancel culture is coming
for a Disney classic.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.478
-Cancel culture extending
its reach -- deep breath --

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:46.946
this time to Snow White.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.514
The mob going after
Prince Charming

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:52.251
for kissing the Princess,
or Snow White, without consent.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:55.054
Snow White could now be
snow woke.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:56.622
[ Clicks tongue ]

00:00:56.622 --> 00:01:00.259
-Yep. Cancel culture going after
poor little Snow White.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:03.229
-When I woke up and I saw
Snow White is now in trouble,

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.298
Molly, I was like,
"Well, it must be Monday."

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.366
-Critics are demanding
Disneyland remove

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.135
the "true love kiss" scene

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.937
from the new ride Snow White.

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.306
-So now they're trying
to cancel Snow White.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:15.208
Your thoughts?
-This ride at Disneyland.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.644
-Yeah. Disneyland.

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:23.883
-You know, sometimes I think,
"We are so screwed."

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.885
I don't know where

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.821
these jack-a-loons
come up with this stuff.

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:32.091
-Probably the same place you
came up with "jack-a-loons."

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.960
What the hell is that, some kind
of cryptocurrency for pirates?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.430
"Prepare to be boarded,
and upload all your jack-a-loons

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.664
to my account.

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:40.400
Arr!

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.568
What's your Wi-Fi?

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:45.238
I think we need to
get on the same Wi-Fi

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.273
for the upload to take place."

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.941
You're a United States senator.

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:51.311
You should be spending your time
talking about stuff that
actually matters

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.878
instead of a ride at Disneyland,

00:01:52.878 --> 00:01:56.048
unless you want to talk about
Mr. Toad's Wild Ride,

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:59.585
because it is very insane to me
that, in that ride,

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:03.089
which is for small children,
Mr. Toad goes to hell.

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:04.990
And doesn't come out,
it should be noted.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:08.761
It just ends there,
in hell, then the ride's over.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.396
"Well, I hope you enjoyed it,
kids,

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.998
and remember, follow
traffic laws or else."

00:02:12.998 --> 00:02:15.400
As for Prince Charming,
I just think the dude

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.836
needs to pick a princess,

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.572
which would have made
a pretty good 2007 movie

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.407
starring Owen Wilson
as Prince Charming

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:22.842
and Vince Vaughn
as his best friend.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.077
"Buddy, buddy, buddy, I know
they're all beautiful honeys,

00:02:25.077 --> 00:02:27.313
but you have to make a choice
and leave some for
the rest of us.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.048
You know, because I asked
Snow White for her number,

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.349
and she says
she's dating Charming.

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:31.918
And Sleeping Beauty
gives me the cold shoulder

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.285
because she's dating Charming.

00:02:33.285 --> 00:02:35.321
And, like, all that's left
is ogres and trolls,

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:36.989
and that's not a comment
on anyone's looks.

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:38.691
They're literally
ogres and trolls."

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:43.162
I have a cold that I thought
would improve my Vince Vaughn,

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:46.199
but I see now that it hurt it.

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.767
Well, we can't unwind the clock.

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.236
At this point,
it's only a matter of time

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.305
before Fox News spends a week
running segments

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.539
warning that Biden is sending

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:55.675
his army
of Antifa super soldiers

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:58.211
to your house
to take away your Beanie Babies.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:03:00.212
So they're obsessed
with election lies

00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:01.648
and insane culture war
bull[bleep]

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.916
Meanwhile, Joe Biden seems to
have checkmated Republicans

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:06.886
with a strategy so shocking,
it never occurred to them --

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.122
doing popular things
that people like.

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:12.225
-Thanks to the Biden
administration's accelerated
vaccination push,

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:14.460
new cases of COVID
are at the lowest point

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.395
since the beginning of October.

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:18.364
In addition,
Biden's stimulus package

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.499
has provided the spark
he promised.

00:03:20.499 --> 00:03:21.668
Look at some of these numbers.

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:25.771
U.S. gross domestic product,
GDP, hit 6.4%.

00:03:25.771 --> 00:03:28.808
That's the second-best
quarterly reading since 2003.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:30.276
Thanks to the stimulus,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.345
Americans actually have
more money to spend.

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:34.013
The amount of money
an individual household has

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:37.983
after taxes
increased $2.36 trillion,

00:03:37.983 --> 00:03:41.053
67% in the first quarter
of 2021.

00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:42.154
-And as President Biden

00:03:42.154 --> 00:03:44.090
completes his first 100 days
in office,

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:48.227
a majority of Americans are more
optimistic about the next year.

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:51.030
That is according to
a new ABC News/Ipsos poll.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.265
Nearly two-thirds, 64%,

00:03:53.265 --> 00:03:55.801
are optimistic about
the direction of the country.

00:03:55.801 --> 00:03:59.104
-Wow, optimism. That is not
a feeling Americans are used to.

00:03:59.104 --> 00:04:01.307
A year ago, we were all
going to the grocery store

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:03.542
in homemade HAZMAT suits
and rubber gloves,

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:05.278
fighting over toilet paper
and oat milk.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:08.647
And, yeah, okay, I'm sorry
I live in a part of the country

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:10.316
where people were fighting
over oat milk.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:11.751
Sue me.

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:13.686
It's the only thing my wife will
let me put in my Kashi cereal.

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:16.456
And if I come back with anything
other than the actual
OATLY! brand,

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:18.324
I have to sit quietly
in the corner

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:21.127
and drink my dandelion tea
with agave and turmeric

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:23.295
because she says turmeric
is good for my memory

00:04:23.295 --> 00:04:24.997
and I'm sweet like agave.

00:04:24.997 --> 00:04:27.834
So after four years
of constant misery,

00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:29.302
there's finally reason
for optimism,

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:30.903
especially when you see
the President

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.805
set an ambitious goal
of getting shots

00:04:32.805 --> 00:04:34.940
to at least 70% of adults
by July 4th,

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:36.675
which is believable
because he's already hit

00:04:36.675 --> 00:04:38.544
several of the goals
he's already set for himself,

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:41.780
like 200 million shots
in his first 100 days.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.117
It's such a jarring change
from the Trump era,

00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:45.551
when he would set
outlandish goals

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:47.853
without absolutely any
credibility to back them up,

00:04:47.853 --> 00:04:49.822
and that's because
he could never stop talking,

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:52.158
even when he was
saying something scripted.

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:54.460
"Today I'm announcing
that by July 4th,

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.730
70% of American adults
will be vaccinated.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.766
