00:10:15.647 --> 00:10:17.516
You can go on Fox
and claim Biden

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:19.118
is going to outlaw hamburgers,

00:10:19.118 --> 00:10:20.619
and the anchors
will take you seriously.

00:10:20.619 --> 00:10:23.655
But if you say the same thing
on the sidewalk in Times Square,

00:10:23.655 --> 00:10:25.457
people would look away
or pretend not to speak English.

00:10:25.457 --> 00:10:28.226
I've pulled that move
walking to work many times.

00:10:28.226 --> 00:10:29.595
"Excuse me,
will you sign my petition

00:10:29.595 --> 00:10:31.296
to stop the President
from banning our hamburgers

00:10:31.296 --> 00:10:33.165
and putting microchips
in our DNA?"

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:35.067
 Scusi, non parlo inglese.

00:10:35.067 --> 00:10:37.436
 Mi chiamo Gabagool.

00:10:37.436 --> 00:10:40.506
This Republican Party
doesn't seem to stand...

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:42.608
[ Laughter ]

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.179
This Republican Party
doesn't seem to stand for

00:10:47.179 --> 00:10:48.714
anything other than
seeking power

00:10:48.714 --> 00:10:50.383
and doing anything possible
to attain it,

00:10:50.383 --> 00:10:52.051
including dismantling democracy.

00:10:52.051 --> 00:10:54.319
They're so fully committed
to Trump's big election lie

00:10:54.319 --> 00:10:57.022
that they're now punishing a
long-time hard-core conservative

00:10:57.022 --> 00:10:58.557
just for living in reality.

00:10:58.557 --> 00:11:01.193
I'm running out of words to
describe how insane this is,

00:11:01.193 --> 00:11:03.996
so I'll just have to start
making up new ones, like...

00:11:03.996 --> 00:11:05.096
-Jack-a-loons.

00:11:05.096 --> 00:11:07.533
-This has been "A Closer Look."

